/// known-gap: interp has no block overlay syntax (overlay name ... xx); the interpreter is being retired
/// An action called by DES (here from an overlay's `on end`) may leave out
/// parameters that have defaults, as a call written in Goblin may.
<>P |
    n: 0
    act finish(k | 5)
        self >> n |= self >> n + k
    end
xx
overlay short
    lasts: 1
    on end => @finish()
xx
p <> P | n: 0
:overlay!(p, short)
:tick()
:tick()
:say(p >> n)
